# Real secrets are never committed...
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env*
# ...but the template README.md and docs/deployment.md tell you to copy must be.
# This negation has to come last: in .gitignore the final matching rule wins, so a
# trailing `.env*` silently drops the template the setup step depends on.
!.env.example

# Regenerable tooling caches and editor config, not part of the submitted artefact.
# `.agents/` is a vendored skill cache reinstalled with `modal skills update`.
/.agents/
/.vscode/
